# Machine Learning Final Project

This repository contains the final project for the Machine Learning course. The project focuses on collecting parking-related data, preparing datasets, and building prediction models for parking space availability.

## Project Structure

```text
Final Project/
├── DataCollection/   # Data collection scripts and API-related utilities
├── Datasets/         # Processed dataset files
├── Logs/             # Runtime logs
├── Model/            # Model training and prediction notebooks
└── README.me
```

